      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h3 id=\"ConfiguringOWAinBahmni-Description\">Description</h3><p><span>OWA’s are simple web apps developed using web technologies like JS, HTML and CSS. OpenMRS REST API can be used for the server side calls. It is configured using an OpenMRS OMOD. Please refer </span><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Open+Web+Apps+Module\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>this</span></a><span> OpenMRS wiki page before configuring the OWA.</span></p><h3 id=\"ConfiguringOWAinBahmni-ConfigureOWAmoduleinBahmni\"><span>Configure OWA module in Bahmni</span></h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5648fd92-3165-4bd4-ac47-97467403e060\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>You will need to do the following only if you have custom setup Bahmni or want to enable OWA in release 0.90 or prior. From 0.91 onwards, the OWA  module comes packaged with Bahmni. If you are looking to write your own OWA, then please refer to the 'Developer Guide'. </p></div></div><ol><li><span>Download the latest version of <em><strong>owa-X.X.omod</strong></em> from </span><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://addons.openmrs.org/show/org.openmrs.module.open-web-apps-module\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>here</span></a><span>.</span></li><li><span>Copy the omod to <em>/opt/openmrs/modules</em> in bahmni instance. And restart the openmrs service.  </span></li></ol><p><br/></p><p><span>This will create owa folder inside <em>/opt/openmrs</em> path. And you will be able to see Open Web Apps Module in OpenMRS Administration page as shown in the below screenshot.</span></p><p><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"86\" width=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.23.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024396630&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=250&amp;height=85\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.23.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024396630&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"507019331\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2018-02-16 at 11.23.24 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"506986528\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"080d7df2-6356-417d-8362-78e372053b77\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.23.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024396630&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=448&amp;height=154 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.23.24%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024396630&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=250&amp;height=85 1x\"></span></span></p><p><span><span>Once the above setup is done, we can add our custom OWA to OpenMRS. This can be done in either of two ways. Check <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-owa-addonmanager\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a>  openmrs owa repo for reference. This repo has detailed instructions on how to deploy the code in server.</span></span></p><ol><li><span>Copy your custom OWA folder inside <em>/opt/openmrs/owa</em> path. Then you can access the app from “Manage Apps” page.</span></li></ol><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"217\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-19%20at%203.30.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519034481644&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=216\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-19%20at%203.30.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519034481644&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"507052063\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2018-02-19 at 3.30.45 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"506986528\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"be442ce6-cd1e-4d36-a0af-c56d041989a3\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-19%20at%203.30.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519034481644&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=432 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-19%20at%203.30.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519034481644&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=216 1x\"></span></p><p><span>      2. <span>Create a zip file out of your custom owa folder. Browse and Upload it from OpenMRS UI as mentioned in the below screenshot. </span></span></p><p><span><span>To upload it from OpenMRS UI, you need to set </span><span><strong>module.allow_web_admin</strong> value to <strong>true</strong> in <em>/opt/openmrs/etc/openmrs-runtime.properties</em> file. This value is set to <strong>false</strong> by default.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"159\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.38.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024735927&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=158\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.38.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024735927&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"506986548\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2018-02-16 at 11.38.02 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"506986528\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"2a349725-f5a3-4a07-baf0-9875d9d8b1bc\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.38.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024735927&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=316 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/506986528/Screen%20Shot%202018-02-16%20at%2011.38.02%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1519024735927&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=158 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"ConfiguringOWAinBahmni-AccessCustomOWAfromBahmniHomepage:\"><strong>Access Custom OWA from Bahmni Home page:</strong></h3><p>If you want to access this custom OWA from Bahmni home page follow below steps. Add below configuration in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/release-0.89/openmrs/apps/home/extension.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">/var/www/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/home/extension.json</a> file.</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"52dcd907-980a-4bc5-b34e-edfe3a2c5330\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\">\n <div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom\">\n  <b class=\"code-title\"> </b><span class=\"collapse-source expand-control\" style=\"display:none;\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\"> </span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">Expand source</span></span><span class=\"collapse-spinner-wrapper\"> </span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar\">\n  <pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence; collapse: true\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;openMRSAddOnManager&quot;: {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.addOnManager&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.home.dashboard&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;OpenMRS Add On Manager&quot;,\n    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;/openmrs/owa/openmrs-addonmanager/index.html&quot;,\n    &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;icon-bahmni-reports&quot;,\n    &quot;order&quot;: 8,\n    &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:admin&quot;\n  }</pre>\n </div>\n</div><p>Make sure to update the <strong>url</strong> with the relevant custom OWA url as shown in the above configuration. Then you will be able to see the app in Bahmni home page.</p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a554f2c2-e09a-4f41-bc87-49f228db5018\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"edfb1f2f-c85b-418b-95f9-05e6be01481e\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"82f3f0db-0a96-4715-a741-311e6d8eda72\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;\"><b>Related Pages</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Open+Web+Apps+Module\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenMRS OWA Wiki</a> </p><p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/506986565/Creating+OWA+Open+Web+Apps+in+Bahmni\" rel=\"nofollow\">Developer Guide</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
